    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\r\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\r\n    <span class=\"chip accent\">Pattern primer</span><span class=\"chip\">Number theory</span><span class=\"chip\">Randomised</span>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <h1>Math and geometry for interviews</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">The maths interviewers actually ask is small: fast power, gcd, a sieve, overflow-safe digit loops, school arithmetic on strings, nCr, one cross product, prefix-sum random picks, reservoir sampling and base conversion. Each one is a 5-15 line template. This page gives you all of them, with the trap that usually breaks each one.</p>\r\n"
